  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I cannot imagine how much more information you require, but let me review if you were not paying attention. You must go to the Ancient Burial Grounds in MooShu and find a place to summon two-headed Orthrus. Is that clear?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_Drake_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfCyrusDrake_QST_125.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38206,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Now that you've got the knowledge of Orthrus, a suitable twin collar for the beast, and a bone to entice it, you are as ready as you can possibly be. There is little more I can do for you in this matter, save for telling you where to best summon the beast. \\n",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_Drake_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfCyrusDrake_QST_126.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38206,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Though his brother Cerberus was a watchdog of the dead, Orthrus was a herd-dog, utilized by the Titans to herd their sacred cattle. As such, there is no better place to summon Orthrus than MooShu.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_Drake_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfCyrusDrake_QST_127.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38206,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Go then, to the Ancient Burial Grounds in MooShu and seek out the proper place to summon two-headed Orthrus. You should seek an entrance to the underground... perhaps guided by a Samoorai spirit.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_Drake_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfCyrusDrake_QST_128.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38206,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I see from your demeanor that you've accomplished the impossible... again. It pains me to say it, but you've become quite the example to the other students. Do not squander my goodwill.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_Drake_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfCyrusDrake_QST_129.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38206,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "This spell should allow you to summon Orthrus to battle whenever you are threatened.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_Drake_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfCyrusDrake_QST_130.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38206,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
